// payment.proto — He-API payment contract for Epic 7 (计费、定价与多通道支付).
// Story 7.3 — FIRST realisation of payment-svc. Defines PaymentEvent (the
// `payment.completed` Kafka payload, data-models §4.4) + PaymentService
// (CreateCheckout / CreateSubscription). There is NO webhook RPC — the gateway
// transparently reverse-proxies the raw webhook bytes to payment-svc's own HTTP
// handler (Q-WEBHOOK-INGRESS), preserving raw-body integrity for HMAC.
